IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. NSIF-ENG.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-GROSS PIC S9(11)V99 COMP-3.
01 WS-EMP   PIC S9(9)V99 COMP-3.
01 WS-CO    PIC S9(9)V99 COMP-3.
01 WS-EMP-DISP PIC ZZZZZZZZ9.99.
01 WS-CO-DISP  PIC ZZZZZZZZ9.99.

LINKAGE SECTION.
01 LS-GROSS-STR PIC X(15).
01 LS-FLAG      PIC X(01).
01 LS-EMP-STR   PIC X(15).
01 LS-CO-STR    PIC X(15).

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LS-GROSS-STR LS-FLAG LS-EMP-STR LS-CO-STR.
    COMPUTE WS-GROSS = FUNCTION NUMVAL(LS-GROSS-STR)
    IF LS-FLAG = "Y" OR LS-FLAG = "y"
        COMPUTE WS-EMP ROUNDED = WS-GROSS * 0.08
        COMPUTE WS-CO ROUNDED = WS-GROSS * 0.17
    ELSE
        MOVE 0 TO WS-EMP WS-CO
    END-IF
    MOVE WS-EMP TO WS-EMP-DISP
    MOVE WS-CO TO WS-CO-DISP
    MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-EMP-DISP) TO LS-EMP-STR
    MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-CO-DISP) TO LS-CO-STR
    GOBACK.
